# Pins for the atc-gateway images. Change a pin in its own commit, then run
# scripts/test-atc-gateway-fixture.sh.

# atc release that holds the gateway binary. atc-gateway is not released yet: until it
# is, the pin is the release whose `atc mcp --http` serves the same HTTP surface, used
# only by the fixture test.
